---
title: Messaging with cursor polling
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor G as Guest
    participant W as Website
    participant A as Django API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    G->>W: Opens a conversation
    W->>A: GET /conversations/{id}/messages?after=0
    A->>DB: messages of the conversation with id greater than 0
    A-->>W: messages and next cursor 1042
    loop every 5 to 15 s while open
        W->>A: GET /conversations/{id}/messages?after=1042
        A-->>W: only new messages (often none)
    end
    G->>W: Types a message containing a phone number
    W->>A: POST /conversations/{id}/messages
    A->>A: detects contact info, booking not confirmed yet
    A->>DB: stores body and masked body, flags it
    A-->>W: 201
    Note over W,A: the host sees the masked text until the booking is confirmed
